        "source": "valmikiramayan.net",
        "net_locator": "1-1-11",
        "spans_beyond_this_verse": false,
        "text": "Up to here the godly physical aspect bhagavadvigraha is explained that which is perceptible by the adherents as said in Chāndogya Upanishad: ya eSo antaraaditye hiraNmayaH puruSo dR^ishyate... 1-6-6. From now on, the features that are reliable for the adherers are said."
      }
